**추천 해결책:**
- `src/utils/collision.ts` 유틸 작성
  ```typescript
  export function checkAABBCollision(
    obj1: { x: number; y: number },
    obj2: { x: number; y: number },
    halfWidthSum: number,
    halfHeightSum: number
  ): boolean {
    return Math.abs(obj2.x - obj1.x) < halfWidthSum && 
           Math.abs(obj2.y - obj1.y) < halfHeightSum;
  }
  ```

